      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 6:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwathi abantu sebeqala ukwanda emhlabeni, bezala amadodakazi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 6:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "amadodana kaNkulunkulu abona amadodakazi abantu ukuthi mahle; athatha abafazi kuwo awathandayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 6:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "INkosi yasisithi: Umoya wami kawuyikuhlala njalo emuntwini njengoba eyinyama nje; kodwa umuntu uzakuhlala iminyaka elikhulu lamatshumi amabili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngalezonsuku kwakukhona iziqhwaga emhlabeni. Emva kokuba amadodana kaNkulunkulu aseyile emadodakazini abantu azala abantwana. Wona ayengamaqhawe asendulo engamadoda alodumo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.13.33"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Nani 13:33",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 6:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "INkosi yasibona ukuthi ububi bomuntu bukhulu emhlabeni, lokuthi yonke imicabango yenhliziyo yakhe mibi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.24.37"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat 24:37",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.17.26"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Luka 17:26",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1PE.3.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Pet 3:20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "INkosi yazisola ngokuthi ibenzile abantu emhlabeni, yadabuka inhliziyo yayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "INkosi yathi: Ngizabachitha abantu engabadalayo ngibasuse emhlabeni, yebo abantu, lezilo, lokuhuquzelayo, lenyoni zaphezulu; ngoba sengizisola ngokuthi ngibenzile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kodwa uNowa wathandeka emehlweni eNkosi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Le yindaba kaNowa. UNowa wayeyindoda elungileyo engasoleki esizukulwaneni sakhe; uNowa wayehamba loNkulunkulu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2PE.2.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Pet 2:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UNowa wazala amadodana amathathu, uShemu loHamu loJafethi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umhlaba wawonakele phambi kukaNkulunkulu, umhlaba wagcwala okubi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 6:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UNkulunkulu wabona ukuthi umhlaba wonakele, ngoba indlela yabantu bonke yayonakele emhlabeni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 6:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UNkulunkulu wasesithi kuNowa: Sengizimisele ukuqeda abantu bonke, ngoba umhlaba ugcwele okubi ngenxa yabo; khangela, ngizabachitha kanye lomhlaba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 6:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakha umkolo ngezigodo zephane, wenze izigaba phakathi kwawo, uwubhade ngengcino ngaphakathi langaphandle. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 6:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nanku ozakukwenza; ubude bawo buzakuba yizingalo ezingamakhulu amathathu, ububanzi bawo bube yizingalo ezingamatshumi amahlanu, lokudepha kwawo kube yizingalo ezingamatshumi amathathu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 6:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uzafaka iwindi emkolweni libe yingalonye kusukela ngaphezulu, ufake umnyango ohlangothini lomkolo, uwenze ube lezindlu ezintathu, enye ngaphansi, lenye phakathi, lenye ngaphezulu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 6:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khangela, ngizathumela uzamcolo wamanzi emhlabeni ukuba achithe bonke abantu abangaphansi komthunzi welanga okukubo umoya wokuphila. Konke okusemhlabeni kuzakufa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 6:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kodwa ngizamisa isivumelwano sami lawe; uzakungena emkolweni wena lamadodana akho lomkakho labafazi bamadodana akho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 6:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uzathatha inyamazana ezimbili kulolo lalolo uhlobo lwezinyamazana zonke eziphilayo, ezinduna lezinsikazi, zingene emkolweni kanye lawe, uzilondoloze. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 6:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kulolo lalolo uhlobo lwezinyoni lezifuyo lakho konke okuhuquzelayo uzakuthatha ezimbili, zingene kanye lawe, ziphile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 6:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uzithathele konke ukudla okudliwayo, uzibekele khona kube yikudla kwakho lokwazo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 6:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wenze njalo uNowa; wakwenza konke uNkulunkulu ayemlayele khona.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.22"
            ]
          }
        },
